   "author_id": 30759,
   "author_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/30759/zan8lele",
   "created_at": "2025-06-30T16:36:52+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>For anyone wondering, you can use the <a href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/184-spt-aki-profile-editor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT profile editor</a> to change the head while you wait for the WTT mod to get updated, it\u2019s a bit of trial and error since it does not show the name of the modded heads, only the numeric id. you used to be able to do that. you can still do it by manually editing your profile (always backup your profile) open your json file and ctrl+f for \u201chead\u201d then swap the id with the one for Ada\u2019s head found in RCTA-Heads.json file in the mod\u2019s db folder. save and voil\u00e0 your head is changed</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
   "likes": 0
